{"items": [{"owner": {"account_id": 3835118, "reputation": 311, "user_id": 3179648, "user_type": "registered", "profile_image": "https://i.sstatic.net/xmNxt.png?s=256", "display_name": "Scott Ganyo", "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/3179648/scott-ganyo"}, "is_accepted": true, "score": 0, "last_activity_date": 1417287990, "creation_date": 1417287990, "answer_id": 27205924, "question_id": 27195817, "content_license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "body": "<p>Please check your \"Base URI\" value. This needs to be the URI of your management endpoint and isn't related to your particular organization. (For example, you can see above that the default for the Apigee hosted environment is <a href=\"https://api.enterprise.apigee.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://api.enterprise.apigee.com</a>.)</p>\n"}, {"owner": {"account_id": 2774584, "reputation": 1, "user_id": 2388402, "user_type": "registered", "profile_image": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/2f1f0d2974754d4aaf5ef9c4f36f42e5?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG", "display_name": "ssh-add", "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/2388402/ssh-add"}, "is_accepted": false, "score": 0, "last_activity_date": 1635366609, "last_edit_date": 1635366609, "creation_date": 1635332012, "answer_id": 69737339, "question_id": 27195817, "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "body": "<p>The Base URL should be something like <code>{org-name}.login.apigee.com/oauth/token</code>. There are other tools like <a href=\"https://github.com/ashishkpathak/adt\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">ADT</a> which can help deploy apiproxies/shared-flows.</p>\n"}], "has_more": false, "quota_max": 300, "quota_remaining": 239}